0.1.0-alpha.3
  - Fix PTZ hover mode initial visibility: initialize showPtz state to false so D-pad and preset chips remain hidden until hovered over
  - Remove aarlo-glance registration alias to eliminate CustomElementRegistry duplicate constructor collisions and avoid interfering with lovelace-hass-aarlo
  - Purge legacy aarlo naming from CSS styles, HTML templates, DOM lookups, and sensor entity resolution
  - Update localization CDN URL to lovelace-hass-foscam

0.1.0-alpha.2
  - Added optical zoom and manual focus controls beside the PTZ D-pad overlay:
    - Optical Zoom: In (mdi:magnify-plus-outline) and Out (mdi:magnify-minus-outline)
    - Manual Focus: Near (mdi:image-filter-center-focus) and Far (mdi:image-filter-center-focus-weak)
    - Center Stop (mdi:stop) halts PTZ, zoom, and focus movements concurrently
    - Responsive alignment: controls extend inward from corners (using row-reverse for right-anchored positions) to avoid card overflow
    - Fullscreen scaling: lens controls scale up to 44px proportionally with D-pad buttons in fullscreen mode
  - Added visual card editor switches: "Show Optical Zoom Controls (In/Out)" and "Show Manual Focus Controls (Near/Far)", off by default to keep standard cameras uncluttered
  - Requires hass-foscam v0.1.0-alpha.5 or later for zoom and focus actions

0.1.0-alpha.1
  - Initial alpha release of foscam-glance custom card for Foscam IP cameras
  - Live RTSP streaming and snapshot viewing
  - On-screen PTZ D-pad overlay on hover (desktop) or tap toggle (mobile)
  - Preset position quick-action buttons
  - Saved clips library modal with HTTP 206 range request scrubbing and seeking
  - Motion detection toggle badge and sensor glance controls
  - Modern modular Rollup build pipeline
